---
const pageTitle = "Video Cursor Tracker – Blind Pixels Studio";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Video Cursor Tracker is a desktop tool that highlights the cursor in videos so it's easier to see during tutorials, meetings, and recordings."
    />
  </head>
  <body class="page">
    <main class="detail layout" aria-labelledby="video-cursor-tracker-heading">
      <a class="detail__back" href="/">← Back to Blind Pixels Studio</a>
      <header class="detail__header">
        <p class="detail__eyebrow">Desktop tool</p>
        <h1 id="video-cursor-tracker-heading">Video Cursor Tracker</h1>
        <p class="detail__lede">
          A desktop tool that highlights the cursor in videos so it's easier to
          see during tutorials, meetings, and recordings.
        </p>
      </header>
      <section class="detail__section">
        <h2>Who it's for</h2>
        <p>
          Creators, educators, and teams who share screen recordings and want
          their audience to follow the cursor without effort.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="detail__section">
        <h2>What it does</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Adds a clear, high-contrast highlight around the cursor.</li>
          <li>Makes cursor movement stand out in recorded videos.</li>
          <li>Helps viewers with low vision or small screens follow along.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="detail__section">
        <h2>Download</h2>
        <p>
          When you're ready, this section can link to installers or a store page.
          For now, it describes how you plan to ship Video Cursor Tracker.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
  <style lang="css">
    body.page {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #14213d 0%, #07090f 60%);
      color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .layout {
      width: min(960px, 100% - 3rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .detail__back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #bfdbfe;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .detail__back:hover,
    .detail__back:focus {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .detail__header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    }

    .detail__eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.8);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .detail__lede {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.86);
    }

    .detail__section {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .detail__section h2 {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .detail__section p,
    .detail__section li {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(226, 232, 255, 0.9);
    }

    .detail__section ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }
  </style>
</html>
